  "description": "Arkcon welcomes you to our recently renovated studio apartment to let on the ever popular Summer St North. Please email your enquiry. Phone call enquires are not accepted due to high volume demand. We aim to respond to all enquiries, however this may not be possible. Thank you for your understanding.  \n\nArkcon are thrilled to present this  recently renovated studio apartment ideally situated on Summer St North. Upon entry to the first ffloor flat, you are welcomed to a modern space, with the property having been renovated in the past year or so. The kitchen has been fitted with modern appliances, including a hob, oven, grill and more. There is a double bed and adequate storage space. The bathroom is meticulous and benefits from instant hot water. On street parking is available. \n\nSummer Street North is a charming tree lined cul de sac close to a host of amenities. The area is well serviced by public transport including The LUAS, multiple bus routes and Connolly Train Station. The M50 and M1 motorways as well as Dublin Airport are easily accessible via the Port Tunnel. There is a new cycleway route currently under construction which will allow a safe cycle path to Howth.\n\nPlease email your enquiry to make this property your own. References and documents are required by all applicants. Available early immediately. Wi-Fi and bins are included.\n\nThank you.",
